#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md
#: 53107770a75f473c920106df98931fde
msgid ""
"Understand GWexpy numerical stability behavior, including whitening eps handling, "
"safe log plotting, NaN and Inf failure modes, and when users should tune parameters."
msgstr "GWexpy の数値安定性ガイドです。whiten の eps 処理、安全な対数表示、NaN / Inf の失敗モード、調整が必要な場面を整理します。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:7
#: d8d2108ce6c540d99e4f48ca573560f1
msgid "Numerical Stability and Precision"
msgstr "数値的安定性と精度"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:10
#: 64924dfb4d11457ea0b172ad74c34d84
msgid "**Who should read this page?** Refer to this detailed guide when:"
msgstr "**このページを読むべき方**：次の場合に、この詳細ガイドを参照してください。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:12
#: 80d5eef35c7e4e97ba9899ba7eae2d61
msgid "You see \"holes\" or \"unusual colors\" in your plots caused by `NaN` or `Inf`."
msgstr "プロット結果に `NaN` や `Inf` による「穴」や「異常な色」が現れた場合"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:13
#: 7cd34395b68043cfa2c2c694e35b2aa8
msgid ""
"You are working with a dynamic range that makes a numerical parameter or plotted "
"scale hard to choose."
msgstr "数値パラメータや描画スケールを選びにくいダイナミックレンジのデータを扱っている。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:14
#: 4e5d39d401c748a28df5da8acf17f8fa
msgid ""
"You want to deeply understand the numerical behavior of algorithms and tune "
"parameters like `eps` or `tol`."
msgstr "解析アルゴリズムの数値的な挙動を深く理解し、詳細パラメータ（`eps`, `tol`）を調整したい場合"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:17
#: 4825609c79294056a4d6e0a0982962e5
msgid ""
"`gwexpy` provides selected stabilization utilities for operations such as whitening "
"and logarithmic conversion. Their behavior and limits depend on the API used."
msgstr "`gwexpy` は、whitening や対数変換などの操作向けに、限定された安定化ユーティリティを提供します。動作と限界は使用する API に依存します。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:20
#: c13d8fdc9fe94c7987bec152cb5718fa
msgid "TL;DR"
msgstr "まず結論だけ知りたい方へ"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:22
#: 6f10606301b846aa814e7cacf1c43e39
msgid "For normal analysis, start by trusting the default `gwexpy` settings."
msgstr "通常の解析では、まず `gwexpy` のデフォルト設定をそのまま使ってください。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:23
#: 1be466e5e5694ca6a7868a534cea32a2
msgid ""
"Do not add manual offsets such as `+ 1e-20` before plotting unless you have a "
"concrete reason."
msgstr "プロット前に `+ 1e-20` のような手動オフセットを足す必要はありません。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:24
#: 6cb3e64cd3d84ad39e588c72262b9051
msgid ""
"Tune parameters only when you actually observe `NaN` / `Inf`, work with extreme "
"amplitudes, or need algorithm-level validation."
msgstr "調整が必要なのは、`NaN` / `Inf` が見える、極端に小さい信号を扱う、アルゴリズム検証をしたい場合に限られます。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:27
#: 4df08c5a4a704a1799e2c3d5736734a3
msgid "Impact of Stabilization (Before & After)"
msgstr "可視化における安定化の効果 (Before & After)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/numerical_stability.md:29
#: d0692f1f60ac4ae6a55c80fde5bee286
msgid ""
"A comparison between standard methods (simple `log10` or fixed `eps`) and `gwexpy`'s "
"robust numerical stabilization algorithms."
msgstr "標準的な手法（単純な `log10` や 固定 `eps`）と、`gwexpy` の数値安定化アルゴリズムを適用した結果の比較です。"

